              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A tụnyere onyinyo cherubim na osisi nkwụ nʼelu ibo na-edubanye nʼụlọ ezumezu ahụ, dịka ndị ahụ a tụrụ nʼahụ mgbidi niile. E jikwa osisi rụchie elu ihu mpụta nke ọnụ ụlọ ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
